               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       FILE-ACCESS-0102.
               EXEC CICS REWRITE FILE('KSDSEN67')
                         FROM(KSDSEN67-REC)
                         LENGTH(WS-FILE-LEN)
